{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125131408846-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125152450\"/><p>人員檢獲一批懷疑氯胺酮。</p><p>​執法人員昨日(24日)在荃灣檢獲約4.3公斤懷疑氯胺酮，估計市值約180萬元，並拘捕一名懷疑涉案男子。</p><p>香港海關昨日在荃灣進行緝毒行動，並於一所工業大廈的分間工作室內，檢獲該批懷疑氯胺酮。其後，人員同日在長沙灣拘捕一名40歲懷疑涉案男子。案件仍在調查中。被捕男子現正保釋候查，不排除會有更多人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:43:58.224658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:14:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T09:57:14.152621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:31.428979+00:00","content_hash":"8a3b66ae62a26a8f03e6216688fea525a1cf4ab904137d45ff5dcb9702654143","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:43:58.224658+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}